# Everything here is copied into a Linux PX4 tree or runs on NuttX/Linux: keep LF on every
# checkout. With core.autocrlf=true on Windows, a CRLF checkout would put carriage returns
# into rc.board_extras (read by NuttX's shell) and change build.sh's commit SHA
# (v1.16.2-2-g5cc214d).
* text=auto eol=lf
